A("Python: Wi-Fi — kengaytirilgan","Bilingan tarmoqlar bazasi va solishtirish","Atrofdagi tarmoqlar ro'yxatini oldindan saqlangan \"bilingan\" ro'yxat bilan solishtirib, notanish SSID paydo bo'lganini aniqlash — Wi-Fi anomaliya monitoringining asosi, lekin bu safar natija JSON faylda saqlanadi va har ishga tushirilganda avtomatik yangilanadi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > wifi_baza.py\nimport json, subprocess\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nBAZA_FAYLI = Path(\"wifi_baza.json\")\n\ndef tarmoqlarni_ol():\n    try:\n        natija = subprocess.run([\"nmcli\", \"-t\", \"-f\", \"SSID\", \"dev\", \"wifi\", \"list\"],\n                                capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n        return set(filter(None, natija.stdout.strip().split(\"\\n\")))\n    except FileNotFoundError:\n        return set()\n\ndef baza_oqi():\n    if BAZA_FAYLI.exists():\n        return set(json.loads(BAZA_FAYLI.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")))\n    return set()\n\ndef baza_yoz(tarmoqlar):\n    BAZA_FAYLI.write_text(json.dumps(sorted(tarmoqlar), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\ndef main():\n    hozirgi = tarmoqlarni_ol()\n    bilingan = baza_oqi()\n    if not bilingan:\n        baza_yoz(hozirgi)\n        print(f\"Boshlang'ich baza yaratildi: {len(hozirgi)} ta tarmoq saqlandi\")\n        return\n    yangi = hozirgi - bilingan\n    yoqolgan = bilingan - hozirgi\n    print(\"OGOHLANTIRISH! Notanish:\", yangi) if yangi else print(\"Yangi tarmoq yo'q.\")\n    if yoqolgan: print(\"Ko'rinmay qolgan:\", yoqolgan)\n    baza_yoz(hozirgi | bilingan)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\nPYEOF2\npython3 wifi_baza.py", "JSON bazaga asoslangan anomaliya kuzatuvi"]]);
A("Python: Wi-Fi — kengaytirilgan","Signal kuchi grafigi (RSSI trend)","Bitta tarmoqning signal kuchini vaqt bo'yicha o'lchab, CSV ga yozib boradi va matplotlib bilan chiziqli grafik chizadi — signal qachon zaiflashayotganini (router joyini o'zgartirish kerakligini) vizual ko'rsatadi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > wifi_rssi_grafik.py\nimport subprocess, sys, time\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use(\"Agg\")\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\ndef signal_ol(ssid):\n    r = subprocess.run([\"nmcli\", \"-t\", \"-f\", \"SSID,SIGNAL\", \"dev\", \"wifi\", \"list\"],\n                       capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n    for qator in r.stdout.strip().split(\"\\n\"):\n        if not qator: continue\n        nom, signal = qator.rsplit(\":\", 1)\n        if nom == ssid: return int(signal)\n    return None\n\ndef main():\n    ssid = sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else \"UyWifi\"\n    olchovlar = []\n    for i in range(10):\n        q = signal_ol(ssid)\n        olchovlar.append(q if q is not None else 0)\n        print(f\"  {i+1}/10: {q if q is not None else 'topilmadi'}%\")\n        time.sleep(3)\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 3.5))\n    ax.plot(range(1, 11), olchovlar, marker=\"o\", color=\"#0f8f7e\")\n    ax.set_title(f\"{ssid} signal kuchi\"); ax.set_ylim(0, 100)\n    fig.savefig(\"wifi_rssi_trend.png\", dpi=120)\n    print(\"Saqlandi: wifi_rssi_trend.png\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\nPYEOF2\npython3 wifi_rssi_grafik.py UyWifi", "vaqt bo'yicha signal grafigi"]]);
A("Python: Wi-Fi — kengaytirilgan","nmcli bilan avtomatik ulanish/uzish","Oldindan saqlangan tarmoq nomiga avtomatik ulanish va kerak bo'lganda uzish — masalan skript tungi vaqtda o'z tarmog'idan uzilib, ertalab qaytadan ulanishini avtomatlashtirish uchun.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > wifi_avtoulanish.py\nimport subprocess, sys\n\ndef ulan(ssid):\n    r = subprocess.run([\"nmcli\", \"con\", \"up\", ssid], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=15)\n    print(r.stdout or r.stderr)\n\ndef uz(ssid):\n    r = subprocess.run([\"nmcli\", \"con\", \"down\", ssid], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=15)\n    print(r.stdout or r.stderr)\n\ndef main():\n    if len(sys.argv) < 3:\n        print(\"Ishlatish: python3 wifi_avtoulanish.py [ulan|uz] TARMOQ_NOMI\"); return\n    amal, ssid = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]\n    (ulan if amal == \"ulan\" else uz if amal == \"uz\" else lambda s: print(\"Noma'lum amal\"))(ssid)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\nPYEOF2\npython3 wifi_avtoulanish.py ulan UyWifi", "tarmoqqa ulanish/uzish avtomatlashtirish"]]);
A("Python: Wi-Fi — kengaytirilgan","Wi-Fi kanal tirbandligini tahlil qilish","Atrofdagi tarmoqlar qaysi kanalda to'planganini sanaydi — eng bo'sh kanalni tanlash orqali o'z routeringiz tezligini oshirish mumkin (2.4 GHz diapazonida 1, 6, 11 kanallar bir-biriga kamroq xalaqit beradi).",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > wifi_kanal.py\nimport subprocess\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef kanal_statistika():\n    r = subprocess.run([\"nmcli\", \"-t\", \"-f\", \"SSID,CHAN\", \"dev\", \"wifi\", \"list\"],\n                       capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n    sanoq = Counter()\n    for qator in r.stdout.strip().split(\"\\n\"):\n        qismlar = qator.rsplit(\":\", 1)\n        if len(qismlar) == 2 and qismlar[1].isdigit():\n            sanoq[int(qismlar[1])] += 1\n    return sanoq\n\nsanoq = kanal_statistika()\nfor kanal, soni in sorted(sanoq.items()):\n    print(f\"  {kanal}-kanal: {'#'*soni} ({soni})\")\nif sanoq:\n    eng_bosh = min(sanoq, key=sanoq.get)\n    print(f\"Eng kam band kanal: {eng_bosh}\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 wifi_kanal.py", "kanal bo'yicha tirbandlik hisoboti"]]);
A("Python: Wi-Fi — kengaytirilgan","Wi-Fi monitoring vositasi — hammasi birga","Bilingan baza, signal trendi, avtomatik ulanish va kanal tahlilini bitta buyruq ostida birlashtirgan amaliy vosita — uy yoki ofis Wi-Fi holatini bir skript bilan to'liq hisobot qiladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > wifi_vosita.py\nimport json, subprocess\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nBAZA_FAYLI = Path(\"wifi_baza.json\")\n\ndef tarmoqlar_royxati():\n    try:\n        r = subprocess.run([\"nmcli\", \"-t\", \"-f\", \"SSID,SIGNAL,CHAN\", \"dev\", \"wifi\", \"list\"],\n                           capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n        return [q for q in r.stdout.strip().split(\"\\n\") if q]\n    except FileNotFoundError:\n        return []\n\ndef tahlil_qil(qatorlar):\n    ssidlar, kanal_sanoq = set(), Counter()\n    for q in qatorlar:\n        qismlar = q.split(\":\")\n        if len(qismlar) >= 3:\n            ssidlar.add(qismlar[0])\n            if qismlar[2].isdigit(): kanal_sanoq[int(qismlar[2])] += 1\n    return ssidlar, kanal_sanoq\n\nqatorlar = tarmoqlar_royxati()\nssidlar, kanal_sanoq = tahlil_qil(qatorlar)\nbilingan = set(json.loads(BAZA_FAYLI.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))) if BAZA_FAYLI.exists() else set()\nyangi = ssidlar - bilingan\nBAZA_FAYLI.write_text(json.dumps(sorted(ssidlar | bilingan), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\nprint(f\"=== Wi-Fi hisoboti ({len(ssidlar)} ta tarmoq) ===\")\nprint(\"OGOHLANTIRISH! Yangi:\", yangi) if yangi else print(\"Hammasi tanish.\")\nif kanal_sanoq:\n    print(\"Eng kam band kanal:\", min(kanal_sanoq, key=kanal_sanoq.get))\nPYEOF2\npython3 wifi_vosita.py", "4 mavzuni birlashtirgan Wi-Fi hisobotchi"]]);
A("Python: Bluetooth — kengaytirilgan","Bluetooth Classic skanerlash (pybluez)","BLE (Bluetooth Low Energy)'dan farqli, Bluetooth Classic — eski uslubdagi qurilmalar (ba'zi quloqchin, printer) uchun; pybluez kutubxonasi faqat Linux'da yaxshi ishlaydi va kam quvvatli BLE'ga qaraganda boshqacha protokol ishlatadi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > bt_classic_skan.py\ntry:\n    import bluetooth\n    print(\"Bluetooth Classic qurilmalar izlanmoqda (8 soniya)...\")\n    qurilmalar = bluetooth.discover_devices(duration=8, lookup_names=True)\n    for manzil, nom in (qurilmalar or []):\n        print(f\"{manzil}  {nom}\")\n    if not qurilmalar:\n        print(\"Hech narsa topilmadi\")\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"pybluez o'rnatilmagan. O'rnatish: pip install pybluez\")\nexcept Exception as xato:\n    print(\"Bluetooth xatosi (adapter yoqilganmi?):\", xato)\nPYEOF2\npython3 bt_classic_skan.py", "Classic Bluetooth qurilmalarini topish"]]);
A("Python: Bluetooth — kengaytirilgan","BLE GATT xizmat va xususiyatlarini o'qish","Har bir BLE qurilma GATT (Generic Attribute Profile) orqali \"xizmat\"larga (service) va ularning \"xususiyatlariga\" (characteristic) ega — masalan batareya darajasi alohida xususiyat sifatida o'qiladi. bleak kutubxonasi bular bilan asinxron ishlaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > ble_gatt.py\nimport asyncio, sys\ntry:\n    from bleak import BleakClient\nexcept ImportError:\n    BleakClient = None\n\nasync def xizmatlarni_oqi(manzil):\n    async with BleakClient(manzil) as mijoz:\n        print(f\"{manzil} ga ulandi, xizmatlar:\")\n        for xizmat in mijoz.services:\n            print(f\"  Xizmat: {xizmat.uuid}\")\n            for x in xizmat.characteristics:\n                print(f\"    Xususiyat: {x.uuid}  ({', '.join(x.properties)})\")\n\nif BleakClient is None:\n    print(\"bleak o'rnatilmagan. O'rnatish: pip install bleak\")\nelif len(sys.argv) < 2:\n    print(\"Ishlatish: python3 ble_gatt.py QURILMA_MANZILI\")\nelse:\n    try:\n        asyncio.run(xizmatlarni_oqi(sys.argv[1]))\n    except Exception as xato:\n        print(\"Ulanib bo'lmadi:\", xato)\nPYEOF2\npython3 ble_gatt.py AA:BB:CC:11:22:33", "BLE qurilma xizmatlarini ko'rish"]]);
A("Python: Bluetooth — kengaytirilgan","BLE RSSI asosida taxminiy masofani hisoblash","Signal kuchi (RSSI, dBm) qurilmagacha bo'lgan masofa bilan taxminan logarifmik bog'liq — aniq o'lchov emas (devor, to'siq ta'sir qiladi), lekin \"yaqin/uzoq\" darajasida foydali taxmin beradi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > ble_masofa.py\ndef masofa_taxmin(rssi, tx_quvvat=-59, n=2.0):\n    return round(10 ** ((tx_quvvat - rssi) / (10 * n)), 2)\n\nfor rssi in [-50, -65, -75, -90]:\n    print(f\"RSSI {rssi} dBm -> taxminan {masofa_taxmin(rssi)} metr\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 ble_masofa.py", "RSSI'dan masofaga taxminiy aylantirish"]]);
A("Python: Bluetooth — kengaytirilgan","Bluetooth monitoring: yangi qurilmani aniqlash","Atrofdagi BLE qurilmalar ro'yxatini davriy skanerlab, oldingi ro'yxat bilan solishtirish — notanish qurilma (masalan tanilmagan tracker) paydo bo'lganda ogohlantirish beradi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > bt_monitor.py\nimport asyncio, time\ntry:\n    from bleak import BleakScanner\nexcept ImportError:\n    BleakScanner = None\n\nBILINGAN = set()\n\nasync def tekshir():\n    qurilmalar = await BleakScanner.discover(timeout=5.0)\n    return {q.address for q in qurilmalar}\n\nasync def main():\n    if BleakScanner is None:\n        print(\"bleak o'rnatilmagan\"); return\n    global BILINGAN\n    try:\n        while True:\n            hozirgi = await tekshir()\n            yangi = hozirgi - BILINGAN\n            if yangi and BILINGAN:\n                print(\"OGOHLANTIRISH! Yangi qurilma(lar):\", yangi)\n            BILINGAN |= hozirgi\n            print(f\"Jami kuzatilgan: {len(BILINGAN)}\")\n            time.sleep(10)\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"To'xtatildi\")\n\nasyncio.run(main())\nPYEOF2\npython3 bt_monitor.py", "yangi/notanish BLE qurilmani aniqlash"]]);
A("Python: Bluetooth — kengaytirilgan","NFC teglarni o'qish asoslari (nfcpy)","NFC — juda qisqa masofali (bir necha santimetr) simsiz aloqa; nfcpy kutubxonasi USB NFC o'quvchi orqali teg (kartochka, yorliq) ma'lumotini o'qiydi. Faqat o'zingizning NFC o'quvchi uskunangiz va o'z teglaringiz bilan ishlating.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > nfc_oqish.py\ntry:\n    import nfc\n    def tegni_oqi(teg):\n        print(\"Teg topildi:\", teg); return True\n    print(\"NFC o'quvchi kutilmoqda...\")\n    with nfc.ContactlessFrontend(\"usb\") as uskuna:\n        uskuna.connect(rdwr={\"on-connect\": tegni_oqi})\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"nfcpy o'rnatilmagan. O'rnatish: pip install nfcpy\")\nexcept OSError as xato:\n    print(\"NFC o'quvchi topilmadi yoki ulanmagan:\", xato)\nPYEOF2\npython3 nfc_oqish.py", "NFC teg o'qish namunasi"]]);
A("Python: Bluetooth — kengaytirilgan","Bluetooth vositasi — hammasi birga","Classic skanerlash, BLE monitoring va RSSI masofa hisoblashni bitta vositaga birlashtirgan amaliy dastur — kerakli kutubxona yo'q bo'lsa, shunchaki o'sha qismni o'tkazib yuboradi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > bt_vosita.py\nimport asyncio\n\ndef masofa_taxmin(rssi, tx_quvvat=-59, n=2.0):\n    return round(10 ** ((tx_quvvat - rssi) / (10 * n)), 2)\n\ndef classic_skan():\n    try:\n        import bluetooth\n        return bluetooth.discover_devices(duration=5, lookup_names=True)\n    except Exception:\n        return []\n\nasync def ble_skan():\n    try:\n        from bleak import BleakScanner\n        q = await BleakScanner.discover(timeout=5.0)\n        return [(d.address, d.name, d.rssi) for d in q]\n    except Exception:\n        return []\n\nasync def main():\n    print(\"=== Bluetooth Classic ===\")\n    print(classic_skan() or \"  topilmadi\")\n    print(\"\\n=== BLE va taxminiy masofa ===\")\n    for manzil, nom, rssi in await ble_skan():\n        m = masofa_taxmin(rssi) if rssi is not None else \"noma'lum\"\n        print(f\"  {manzil}  {nom or 'nomsiz'}  RSSI={rssi}  ~{m}m\")\n\nasyncio.run(main())\nPYEOF2\npython3 bt_vosita.py", "Bluetooth Classic + BLE birlashtirilgan hisobot"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","SDR bilan FM radio demodulatsiyasi","rtl_fm — RTL-SDR uskunasi bilan birga keladigan buyruq qatori vositasi, FM radio signalini tovushga aylantiradi; Python esa uni subprocess orqali boshqarib, natijani faylga yozadi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > fm_demodulatsiya.py\nimport subprocess, sys\n\ndef fm_yoz(chastota_mhz, davomiylik=10, fayl=\"fm_yozuv.wav\"):\n    chastota_hz = f\"{float(chastota_mhz)}M\"\n    buyruq = [\"timeout\", str(davomiylik), \"rtl_fm\", \"-f\", chastota_hz, \"-M\", \"fm\", \"-s\", \"200000\", \"-r\", \"48000\", fayl]\n    natija = subprocess.run(buyruq, capture_output=True, text=True)\n    print(f\"Saqlandi: {fayl}\" if natija.returncode in (0, 124) else natija.stderr)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    chastota = sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else \"100.5\"\n    try:\n        fm_yoz(chastota)\n    except FileNotFoundError:\n        print(\"rtl_fm topilmadi. O'rnatish: sudo apt install rtl-sdr\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 fm_demodulatsiya.py 100.5", "RTL-SDR bilan FM radio yozib olish"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","SDR bilan ADS-B (samolyot kuzatuv) signalini qabul qilish","ADS-B — samolyotlar o'z joylashuvi va balandligini ochiq, shifrlanmagan 1090 MHz chastotada uzatadi; dump1090 vositasi RTL-SDR orqali shu signallarni dekodlab, JSON formatida beradi, Python esa natijani o'qib jadval qiladi. Passiv qabul qilish — bu nazorat, hujum emas.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > adsb_oqi.py\nimport requests\n\ndef samolyotlarni_oqi():\n    try:\n        j = requests.get(\"http://127.0.0.1:8080/data/aircraft.json\", timeout=3)\n        j.raise_for_status()\n        return j.json().get(\"aircraft\", [])\n    except requests.RequestException as xato:\n        print(\"dump1090 serveriga ulanib bo'lmadi:\", xato)\n        return []\n\nfor s in samolyotlarni_oqi():\n    print(s.get(\"hex\"), s.get(\"flight\", \"\").strip(), s.get(\"alt_baro\"), s.get(\"lat\"), s.get(\"lon\"))\nPYEOF2\npython3 adsb_oqi.py", "mahalliy dump1090 JSON manbasidan samolyotlar"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","scipy.signal bilan past chastotali filtr","Haqiqiy signal har doim shovqin bilan aralash keladi; Butterworth filtri kerakli chastota diapazonini qoldirib, qolganini kamaytiradi — SDR, audio va sensor ma'lumotlarini tozalashda keng ishlatiladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > filtr_mashq.py\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import signal\n\nfs = 1000\nt = np.linspace(0, 1, fs, endpoint=False)\ntoza = np.sin(2*np.pi*5*t)\nshovqin = 0.5*np.sin(2*np.pi*150*t)\naralash = toza + shovqin\n\nb, a = signal.butter(4, 20, fs=fs, btype=\"low\")\ntozalangan = signal.filtfilt(b, a, aralash)\n\nprint(\"Oldin std:\", round(np.std(aralash), 3))\nprint(\"Keyin std:\", round(np.std(tozalangan), 3))\nprint(\"Filtr ishladi:\", np.std(tozalangan) < np.std(aralash))\nPYEOF2\npython3 filtr_mashq.py", "Butterworth low-pass filtr"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","Mikrofon orqali real vaqtli audio tahlili","sounddevice kutubxonasi mikrofondan qisqa bo'lak (frame) yozib oladi, numpy esa shu bo'lakning eng kuchli chastotasini (asosiy tovush balandligi) hisoblaydi — oddiy \"tovush balandligi monitori\" asosi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > audio_tahlil.py\nimport numpy as np\ntry:\n    import sounddevice as sd\n    davomiylik, fs = 2, 44100\n    yozuv = sd.rec(int(davomiylik*fs), samplerate=fs, channels=1, dtype=\"float64\")\n    sd.wait()\n    signal = yozuv.flatten()\n    spektr = np.fft.fft(signal)\n    chastotalar = np.fft.fftfreq(len(signal), 1/fs)\n    yarim = len(signal)//2\n    eng_kuchli = chastotalar[:yarim][np.argmax(np.abs(spektr[:yarim]))]\n    print(f\"Eng kuchli chastota: {abs(eng_kuchli):.1f} Hz\")\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"sounddevice o'rnatilmagan. O'rnatish: pip install sounddevice\")\nexcept Exception as xato:\n    print(\"Mikrofon topilmadi:\", xato)\nPYEOF2\npython3 audio_tahlil.py", "mikrofondan eng kuchli chastotani topish"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","Signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) hisoblash","SNR — foydali signal quvvatining shovqin quvvatiga nisbati, odatda desibelda (dB) ifodalanadi; qancha yuqori bo'lsa, signal shuncha \"toza\". Radio, audio va sensor sifatini baholashda standart ko'rsatkich.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > snr_hisobla.py\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef snr_db(signal, shovqin):\n    return 10*np.log10(np.mean(signal**2)/np.mean(shovqin**2))\n\nfs = 1000\nt = np.linspace(0, 1, fs, endpoint=False)\ntoza = np.sin(2*np.pi*10*t)\nshovqin = np.random.normal(0, 0.3, fs)\nprint(f\"SNR: {snr_db(toza, shovqin):.2f} dB\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 snr_hisobla.py", "signal/shovqin nisbatini hisoblash"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","Power spectral density (PSD) tahlili","FFT faqat bitta namunadagi chastota tarkibini ko'rsatsa, PSD (Welch metodi orqali) signal quvvatining chastota bo'yicha taqsimotini statistik jihatdan barqarorroq hisoblaydi — shovqinli, uzun signallar uchun FFT'dan ishonchliroq.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > psd_tahlil.py\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import signal\n\nfs = 1000\nt = np.linspace(0, 10, fs*10, endpoint=False)\naralash = np.sin(2*np.pi*50*t) + 0.5*np.random.normal(size=len(t))\n\nchastotalar, quvvat = signal.welch(aralash, fs=fs, nperseg=1024)\neng_kuchli = chastotalar[np.argmax(quvvat)]\nprint(f\"PSD bo'yicha eng kuchli chastota: {eng_kuchli:.1f} Hz\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 psd_tahlil.py", "Welch metodi bilan spektral zichlik"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","Wavelet transformatsiya — FFT'dan farqi","FFT butun signal bo'yicha o'rtacha chastota tarkibini beradi, lekin \"chastota QACHON o'zgargani\"ni yo'qotadi; wavelet transformatsiya vaqt va chastotani bir vaqtda ko'rsatadi — chastotasi vaqt o'tishi bilan o'zgaradigan signallar uchun qulayroq.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > wavelet_mashq.py\nimport numpy as np\ntry:\n    import pywt\n    fs = 500\n    t = np.linspace(0, 1, fs, endpoint=False)\n    signal = np.sin(2*np.pi*(20 + 80*t)*t)\n    koef, chastotalar = pywt.cwt(signal, np.arange(1, 64), \"morl\", sampling_period=1/fs)\n    idx = np.argmax(np.abs(koef), axis=0)\n    for i in range(5):\n        print(f\"t={t[i]:.3f}s -> {chastotalar[idx[i]]:.1f} Hz\")\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"pywavelets o'rnatilmagan. O'rnatish: pip install pywavelets\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 wavelet_mashq.py", "vaqt-chastota tahlili"]]);
A("Python: Signallar (SDR) — kengaytirilgan","Real-time spektrogramma animatsiyasi","Statik PNG o'rniga, matplotlib FuncAnimation yordamida spektrogramma oynasi jonli yangilanib turadi — signal monitoring paneli (dashboard) yasashning birinchi qadami.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > spektrogramma_animatsiya.py\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use(\"Agg\")\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.animation as animation\n\nfs, davomiylik = 1000, 5\nt_umumiy = np.linspace(0, davomiylik, fs*davomiylik)\nsignal_umumiy = np.sin(2*np.pi*(10 + 30*t_umumiy)*t_umumiy)\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 3.5))\n\ndef yangila(kadr):\n    ax.clear()\n    boshi = kadr*fs//2\n    oyna = signal_umumiy[boshi:boshi+fs]\n    if len(oyna) > 10:\n        ax.specgram(oyna, Fs=fs, cmap=\"viridis\")\n    ax.set_title(f\"Spektrogramma (kadr {kadr})\")\n\nanim = animation.FuncAnimation(fig, yangila, frames=8, interval=500)\nanim.save(\"spektrogramma_animatsiya.gif\", writer=\"pillow\", fps=2)\nprint(\"Saqlandi: spektrogramma_animatsiya.gif\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 spektrogramma_animatsiya.py", "jonli yangilanadigan spektrogramma"]]);
A("Python: IoT va GPS","GPS NMEA ma'lumotlarini o'qish","Ko'p USB/UART GPS modullari NMEA formatidagi matn qatorlarini uzatadi (masalan $GPGGA); pyserial port orqali shu qatorlarni o'qiydi, pynmea2 esa ularni kenglik/uzunlik kabi qulay qiymatlarga aylantiradi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > gps_oqish.py\ntry:\n    import pynmea2, serial\n    PORT = \"/dev/ttyUSB0\"\n    with serial.Serial(PORT, baudrate=9600, timeout=1) as port:\n        for _ in range(20):\n            qator = port.readline().decode(errors=\"ignore\").strip()\n            if qator.startswith((\"$GPGGA\", \"$GNGGA\")):\n                x = pynmea2.parse(qator)\n                print(f\"Kenglik: {x.latitude}, Uzunlik: {x.longitude}, Yo'ldoshlar: {x.num_sats}\")\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"pyserial/pynmea2 o'rnatilmagan. O'rnatish: pip install pyserial pynmea2\")\nexcept Exception as xato:\n    print(\"GPS modul topilmadi:\", xato)\n    import pynmea2 as _p\n    namuna = \"$GPGGA,123519,4807.038,N,01131.000,E,1,08,0.9,545.4,M,46.9,M,,*47\"\n    x = _p.parse(namuna)\n    print(f\"Namuna: Kenglik {x.latitude}, Uzunlik {x.longitude}\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 gps_oqish.py", "GPS modulidan koordinata o'qish"]]);
A("Python: IoT va GPS","Zigbee va LoRa — uzoq masofali IoT protokollari (nazariy)","Zigbee — kam quvvat sarflaydigan, uy avtomatlashtirish (aqlli lampa, sensor) uchun mo'ljallangan qisqa-o'rta masofali \"mesh\" (to'r) tarmoq protokoli. LoRa/LoRaWAN esa juda kam ma'lumot tezligida, lekin bir necha kilometr masofaga yetadigan, qishloq xo'jaligi sensorlari kabi uzoq, kam quvvatli IoT qurilmalarida ishlatiladi. Ikkalasi ham maxsus USB koordinator yoki SPI modul (masalan RFM95) orqali Python'dan boshqariladi.",[["echo 'Zigbee: mesh tarmoq, qisqa masofa, kam quvvat (zigpy + ConBee/Sonoff dongle). LoRa: uzoq masofa (km), juda past tezlik (RFM95 + adafruit-circuitpython-rfm9x).'", "Zigbee va LoRa qisqa taqqoslash"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","Xavfsiz kod yozish qoidalari","subprocess chaqirishda shell=True o'rniga argumentlar ro'yxatini ishlatish (buyruq in'ektsiyasidan himoya), foydalanuvchi kiritgan matnni eval()/exec() orqali bajarmaslik, tasodifiy tokenlar uchun random o'rniga secrets modulini ishlatish — chunki random bashorat qilinishi mumkin, secrets kriptografik jihatdan xavfsiz.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > xavfsiz_kod.py\nimport subprocess, secrets\n\n# NOTO'G'RI: subprocess.run(f\"ping -c 1 {manzil}\", shell=True) -- buyruq in'ektsiyasiga ochiq\n\n# TO'G'RI: argumentlar ro'yxati, shell ishtirokisiz\ndef xavfsiz_ping(manzil):\n    natija = subprocess.run([\"ping\", \"-c\", \"1\", manzil], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5)\n    return natija.returncode == 0\n\ntoken = secrets.token_urlsafe(32)\nprint(\"Xavfsiz token:\", token)\nprint(\"127.0.0.1 javob beryaptimi:\", xavfsiz_ping(\"127.0.0.1\"))\nPYEOF2\npython3 xavfsiz_kod.py", "shell=True xavfidan qochish, secrets bilan token"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","Fayl yaxlitligini nazorat qilish (integrity monitoring)","Muhim fayllarning (konfiguratsiya, binary) SHA-256 xeshini bazaga saqlab, vaqt o'tib qayta hisoblash orqali ruxsatsiz o'zgarishni aniqlash — tripwire/AIDE vositalari ishlatadigan asosiy g'oya.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > yaxlitlik_nazorati.py\nimport hashlib, json, os\n\nBAZA_FAYLI = \"yaxlitlik_baza.json\"\nNAZORAT_QILINADIGAN = [\"/etc/hosts\", \"/etc/passwd\"]\n\ndef fayl_xeshi(yol):\n    h = hashlib.sha256()\n    with open(yol, \"rb\") as f:\n        for qism in iter(lambda: f.read(8192), b\"\"):\n            h.update(qism)\n    return h.hexdigest()\n\ndef baza_yarat():\n    baza = {y: fayl_xeshi(y) for y in NAZORAT_QILINADIGAN if os.path.exists(y)}\n    with open(BAZA_FAYLI, \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(baza, f, indent=2)\n    print(\"Baza yaratildi\")\n\ndef tekshir():\n    if not os.path.exists(BAZA_FAYLI):\n        baza_yarat(); return\n    with open(BAZA_FAYLI) as f:\n        baza = json.load(f)\n    for yol, eski in baza.items():\n        if not os.path.exists(yol):\n            print(f\"OGOHLANTIRISH: {yol} o'chirilgan!\"); continue\n        print(f\"OK: {yol}\" if fayl_xeshi(yol) == eski else f\"OGOHLANTIRISH: {yol} o'zgartirilgan!\")\n\ntekshir()\nPYEOF2\npython3 yaxlitlik_nazorati.py", "SHA-256 asosida fayl o'zgarishini aniqlash"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","Shifrlash kutubxonasi (cryptography / Fernet)","Fernet — simmetrik shifrlash: bitta kalit bilan ham shifrlanadi, ham ochiladi. Kalitni xavfsiz joyda saqlash shart, chunki u yo'qolsa ma'lumot tiklanmaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > fayl_shifrlash.py\nfrom cryptography.fernet import Fernet\n\nkalit = Fernet.generate_key()\nwith open(\"maxfiy.key\", \"wb\") as f:\n    f.write(kalit)\n\nf = Fernet(kalit)\nmatn = b\"Maxfiy hisobot matni\"\nshifrlangan = f.encrypt(matn)\nprint(\"Shifrlangan:\", shifrlangan[:30], \"...\")\n\nochilgan = f.decrypt(shifrlangan)\nprint(\"Mos keladimi:\", ochilgan == matn)\nPYEOF2\npython3 fayl_shifrlash.py", "Fernet bilan shifrlash va ochish"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","SSL/TLS sertifikat muddatini tekshirish","Sayt sertifikatining amal qilish muddati tugashiga qancha qolganini avtomatik aniqlab, muddati yaqinlashganda ogohlantirish — ishlab turgan serverlarni kuzatish uchun keng tarqalgan monitoring vazifasi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > sertifikat_tekshir.py\nimport ssl, socket, datetime\n\ndef sertifikat_muddati(host, port=443):\n    ctx = ssl.create_default_context()\n    with socket.create_connection((host, port), timeout=5) as sock:\n        with ctx.wrap_socket(sock, server_hostname=host) as ssock:\n            sert = ssock.getpeercert()\n    tugash = datetime.datetime.strptime(sert[\"notAfter\"], \"%b %d %H:%M:%S %Y %Z\")\n    return tugash, (tugash - datetime.datetime.utcnow()).days\n\nfor host in [\"example.com\"]:\n    try:\n        tugash, qolgan = sertifikat_muddati(host)\n        print(f\"{host}: {tugash.date()} gacha ({qolgan} kun qoldi)\" + (\" - YAQINLASHMOQDA!\" if qolgan < 30 else \"\"))\n    except Exception as xato:\n        print(f\"{host}: tekshirib bo'lmadi - {xato}\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 sertifikat_tekshir.py", "sertifikat muddatini monitoring qilish"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","CVE ma'lumotlarini qidirish (NVD API)","Milliy zaifliklar bazasi (NVD) ochiq API orqali ma'lum CVE haqida tavsif va jiddiylik (CVSS) ballarini qaytaradi — bu faqat ma'lumot olish, hech qanday tizimga ta'sir qilmaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > cve_qidir.py\nimport requests\n\ndef cve_malumot(cve_id):\n    url = f\"https://services.nvd.nist.gov/rest/json/cves/2.0?cveId={cve_id}\"\n    r = requests.get(url, timeout=10)\n    if r.status_code != 200: return None\n    try:\n        item = r.json()[\"vulnerabilities\"][0][\"cve\"]\n        return item[\"descriptions\"][0][\"value\"]\n    except (KeyError, IndexError):\n        return None\n\nprint(cve_malumot(\"CVE-2021-44228\") or \"Ma'lumot topilmadi\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 cve_qidir.py", "NVD API orqali CVE tavsifini olish"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","Oddiy ulanish detektori (honeypot asoslari)","Kutilmagan portga kim ulanmoqchi bo'lsa, buni jurnalga yozib qo'yadigan oddiy \"tuzoq\" — faqat o'zingizga tegishli serverda, hech qanday haqiqiy xizmat ishlamaydigan portda ishlating.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > oddiy_honeypot.py\nimport socket, datetime\n\nPORT = 8421\n\ndef log_yoz(manzil):\n    vaqt = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    yozuv = f\"{vaqt}  ulanish: {manzil}\\n\"\n    with open(\"honeypot.log\", \"a\") as f:\n        f.write(yozuv)\n    print(yozuv.strip())\n\ns = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM)\ns.setsockopt(socket.SOL_SOCKET, socket.SO_REUSEADDR, 1)\ns.bind((\"0.0.0.0\", PORT))\ns.listen(5)\nprint(f\"Tuzoq {PORT}-portda ishga tushdi (Ctrl+C bilan to'xtatish)...\")\ntry:\n    while True:\n        klient, manzil = s.accept()\n        log_yoz(manzil)\n        klient.close()\nexcept KeyboardInterrupt:\n    print(\"To'xtatildi\")\nfinally:\n    s.close()\nPYEOF2\npython3 oddiy_honeypot.py", "kutilmagan ulanishlarni jurnalga yozish"]]);
A("Python: Xavfsizlik dasturlari","Xavfsizlik hisobotini avtomatik yaratish","Yig'ilgan natijalarni (port holati, sertifikat muddati, shubhali IP'lar) tartibli Markdown hisobotga aylantirish — haqiqiy ishda topilmalarni qo'lda formatlash o'rniga vaqtni tejaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > hisobot_yarat.py\nimport datetime\n\ndef hisobot_yoz(natijalar, fayl_nomi=\"xavfsizlik_hisoboti.md\"):\n    vaqt = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\n    with open(fayl_nomi, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(f\"# Xavfsizlik tekshiruvi hisoboti\\n\\n**Sana:** {vaqt}\\n\\n\")\n        for sarlavha, qatorlar in natijalar.items():\n            f.write(f\"## {sarlavha}\\n\\n\")\n            for q in qatorlar:\n                f.write(f\"- {q}\\n\")\n            f.write(\"\\n\")\n    print(f\"Hisobot saqlandi: {fayl_nomi}\")\n\nhisobot_yoz({\n    \"Ochiq portlar\": [\"22 - ochiq (SSH)\", \"80 - yopiq\"],\n    \"Sertifikat holati\": [\"example.com - 45 kun qoldi\"],\n    \"Tavsiyalar\": [\"SSH uchun parol o'rniga kalit autentifikatsiyasiga o'ting\"],\n})\nPYEOF2\npython3 hisobot_yarat.py", "natijalarni Markdown hisobotga aylantirish"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","class va __init__","Klass — ob'ekt uchun qolip. __init__ ob'ekt yaratilganda ishlaydi, self — ob'ektning o'zi. Metod — klass ichidagi funksiya. Ma'lumot (atribut) va unga tegishli amallar bir joyda turadi, shuning uchun kod tartibli bo'ladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > portskaner_oop.py\nimport socket\n\nclass PortSkaner:\n    \"\"\"Bitta host uchun port tekshiruvchi klass.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, ip=\"127.0.0.1\", timeout=0.5):\n        self.ip = ip\n        self.timeout = timeout\n        self.ochiq = []\n\n    def tekshir(self, port):\n        with socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM) as s:\n            s.settimeout(self.timeout)\n            return s.connect_ex((self.ip, port)) == 0\n\n    def skanla(self, portlar):\n        self.ochiq = [p for p in portlar if self.tekshir(p)]\n        return self.ochiq\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return f\"PortSkaner({self.ip}, ochiq={self.ochiq})\"\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sk = PortSkaner()\n    sk.skanla([22, 80, 443, 8080])\n    print(sk)\nPYEOF2\npython3 portskaner_oop.py", "OOP uslubida port skaner"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Meros olish (inheritance) va super()","Bola klass ota klassning hamma imkoniyatini oladi va o'zinikini qo'shadi yoki almashtiradi. super() ota klassga murojaat qiladi. Umumiy qismni bir marta yozib, har xil tahlilchilarni undan hosil qilasiz.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > meros.py\nclass Tahlilchi:\n    def __init__(self, nom):\n        self.nom = nom\n    def tahlil(self, malumot):\n        raise NotImplementedError(\"bola klass yozishi kerak\")\n    def hisobot(self, malumot):\n        return f\"[{self.nom}] {self.tahlil(malumot)}\"\n\nclass PortTahlilchi(Tahlilchi):\n    XAVFLI = {21: \"FTP\", 23: \"Telnet\", 3389: \"RDP\"}\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__(\"Port\")\n    def tahlil(self, malumot):\n        return [f\"{p} ({self.XAVFLI[p]})\" for p in malumot if p in self.XAVFLI]\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(PortTahlilchi().hisobot([22, 23, 80, 3389]))\nPYEOF2\npython3 meros.py", "ota/bola klass va super()"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Iteratorlar: for ichki mexanizmi","for sikli ichida iter() obyektdan iterator oladi va StopIteration chiqquncha next() ni chaqiradi. O'z klassingizga __iter__ va __next__ yozsangiz, u ham for da ishlaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > iterator_ichki.py\nclass Sanagich:\n    \"\"\"1 dan chegaragacha sanaydigan o'z iteratorimiz.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, chegara):\n        self.chegara = chegara\n        self.joriy = 0\n    def __iter__(self):\n        return self\n    def __next__(self):\n        self.joriy += 1\n        if self.joriy > self.chegara:\n            raise StopIteration\n        return self.joriy\n\nprint(list(Sanagich(5)))\nPYEOF2\npython3 iterator_ichki.py", "__iter__ va __next__ bilan o'z iteratorini yasash"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","yield va generator","yield funksiyani generatorga aylantiradi: u qiymatni qaytaradi, lekin to'xtab turadi va keyingi next() da davom etadi. Katta log faylni xotiraga to'liq yuklamasdan, qator-qator o'qish uchun ideal. Generatorlarni zanjir (pipeline) qilib ulash mumkin.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > generator_log.py\ndef qatorlar(fayl):\n    with open(fayl, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        for qator in f:\n            yield qator.rstrip(\"\\n\")\n\ndef faqat_xato(oqim):\n    for q in oqim:\n        if \"Failed\" in q:\n            yield q\n\nwith open(\"namuna_auth.log\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for i in range(1000):\n        f.write(\"Failed password for root 203.0.113.1\\n\" if i % 10 == 0 else \"Accepted publickey for ali 10.0.0.5\\n\")\n\nsanoq = sum(1 for _ in faqat_xato(qatorlar(\"namuna_auth.log\")))\nprint(\"Xato urinishlar soni:\", sanoq)\n\nkvadratlar = (n*n for n in range(1000000))   # () - generator ifodasi, xotira tejaydi\nprint(\"Birinchi 3 ta:\", [next(kvadratlar) for _ in range(3)])\nPYEOF2\npython3 generator_log.py", "katta logni oz xotira bilan tahlil qilish"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Closure","Ichki funksiya tashqi funksiyaning o'zgaruvchisini \"eslab qoladi\". Bu dekoratorlarning asosi: tashqi funksiya tugasa ham, ichki funksiya uning qiymatlaridan foydalana oladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > closure.py\ndef hisoblagich_yarat(boshlash=0):\n    son = boshlash\n    def qosh():\n        nonlocal son\n        son += 1\n        return son\n    return qosh\n\nurinish = hisoblagich_yarat()\nprint(urinish(), urinish(), urinish())\nboshqa = hisoblagich_yarat(100)\nprint(boshqa(), urinish())   # har birining o'z xotirasi bor\nPYEOF2\npython3 closure.py", "eslab qoladigan ichki funksiya"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Dekorator (parametrli, functools.wraps)","Dekorator — funksiyani o'zgartirmasdan unga yangi xususiyat qo'shadigan funksiya. @nom sintaksisi f = nom(f) ning qisqa yozuvi. functools.wraps asl funksiyaning nomini saqlaydi. Parametrli dekorator (@qayta_urinish(3)) qo'shimcha bir qavat talab qiladi — tarmoq so'rovlarini avtomatik qayta urinishda keng ishlatiladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > dekoratorlar.py\nimport functools, random, time\n\ndef qayta_urinish(marta=3, kutish=0.1):\n    def dekorator(f):\n        @functools.wraps(f)\n        def ichki(*args, **kwargs):\n            for urinish in range(1, marta + 1):\n                try:\n                    return f(*args, **kwargs)\n                except Exception as xato:\n                    print(f\"{urinish}-urinish xato: {xato}\")\n                    if urinish == marta: raise\n                    time.sleep(kutish)\n        return ichki\n    return dekorator\n\n@qayta_urinish(marta=4)\ndef beqaror_ulanish():\n    if random.random() < 0.7:\n        raise ConnectionError(\"ulanish uzildi\")\n    return \"ulandi\"\n\ntry:\n    print(beqaror_ulanish())\nexcept ConnectionError:\n    print(\"Barcha urinishlar muvaffaqiyatsiz\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 dekoratorlar.py", "parametrli qayta-urinish dekoratori"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Context manager (with, __enter__/__exit__)","with kirishda __enter__ ni, chiqishda (xato bo'lsa ham) __exit__ ni chaqiradi. Shu sabab with open(...) faylni o'zi yopadi. O'z resurslaringiz (ulanish, vaqt o'lchash) uchun ham yozish mumkin.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > context_manager.py\nimport socket, time\nfrom contextlib import contextmanager\n\nclass TCPUlanish:\n    def __init__(self, ip, port, timeout=0.5):\n        self.manzil = (ip, port); self.timeout = timeout\n    def __enter__(self):\n        self.soket = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM)\n        self.soket.settimeout(self.timeout)\n        self.natija = self.soket.connect_ex(self.manzil)\n        return self\n    def __exit__(self, *_):\n        self.soket.close()\n        print(\"Ulanish yopildi\")\n        return False\n\n@contextmanager\ndef vaqt_olchagich(nom):\n    boshi = time.perf_counter()\n    try:\n        yield\n    finally:\n        print(f\"{nom}: {time.perf_counter()-boshi:.3f} s\")\n\nwith vaqt_olchagich(\"tekshiruv\"):\n    with TCPUlanish(\"127.0.0.1\", 22) as u:\n        print(\"22-port:\", \"ochiq\" if u.natija == 0 else \"yopiq\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 context_manager.py", "o'z context manager klassi va funksiyasi"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Istisnolar (exceptions) chuqurroq","Exception dan meros olib o'z xatoingizni yarating — shunda xato nimaligini aniq ajratasiz. except bloklari yuqoridan pastga tekshiriladi: avval aniq turlar, oxirida umumiy Exception. raise ... from ... asl sababni saqlaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > istisnolar.py\nclass SkanXatosi(Exception):\n    \"\"\"Barcha skaner xatolari uchun ota klass.\"\"\"\n\nclass NotogriPort(SkanXatosi):\n    def __init__(self, port):\n        super().__init__(f\"Port 1-65535 oralig'ida bo'lishi kerak: {port}\")\n\ndef port_tekshir(port):\n    if not isinstance(port, int) or not 1 <= port <= 65535:\n        raise NotogriPort(port)\n    return True\n\nfor p in [80, 70000, \"x\"]:\n    try:\n        port_tekshir(p)\n        print(p, \"-> OK\")\n    except NotogriPort as x:\n        print(\"Port xatosi:\", x)\n    except SkanXatosi as x:\n        print(\"Skaner xatosi:\", x)\n\ntry:\n    int(\"abc\")\nexcept ValueError as xato:\n    try:\n        raise SkanXatosi(\"Port o'qilmadi\") from xato\n    except SkanXatosi as yangi:\n        print(yangi, \"| sabab:\", repr(yangi.__cause__))\nPYEOF2\npython3 istisnolar.py", "o'z xato ierarxiyasi va raise...from"]]);
A("Python: Professional dasturchi","Type hints va dataclasses","def tekshir(ip: str, port: int) -> bool: — turlar kodni o'qishni osonlashtiradi va mypy kabi vosita xatoni bajarmasdan topadi. @dataclass esa __init__, __repr__ va __eq__ ni o'zi yozib beradi — ma'lumot saqlovchi klasslar bir necha qatorga sig'adi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > dataclass_natija.py\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n@dataclass\nclass SkanNatijasi:\n    ip: str\n    ochiq_portlar: list[int] = field(default_factory=list)\n    vaqt: str = field(default_factory=lambda: datetime.now().isoformat(timespec=\"seconds\"))\n\n    @property\n    def xavfli(self) -> bool:\n        return any(p in (21, 23, 3389) for p in self.ochiq_portlar)\n\nn = SkanNatijasi(\"127.0.0.1\", [22, 23, 80])\nprint(n)\nprint(\"Xavfli:\", n.xavfli)\nPYEOF2\npython3 dataclass_natija.py", "turlar bilan annotatsiya va dataclass"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","threading, Lock va ThreadPoolExecutor","Tarmoq so'rovlari asosan kutish bilan o'tadi, shuning uchun bir nechta oqim (thread) bir vaqtda kutsa, ish keskin tezlashadi. Umumiy o'zgaruvchini bir nechta oqim o'zgartirsa, natijaning buzilmasligi uchun Lock kerak.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > oqimlar.py\nimport threading, time\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\ndef sekin_tekshir(port):\n    time.sleep(0.05)\n    return port, port % 7 == 0\n\nportlar = list(range(1, 101))\nboshi = time.perf_counter()\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=20) as hovuz:\n    parallel = list(hovuz.map(sekin_tekshir, portlar))\nprint(f\"20 oqim: {time.perf_counter()-boshi:.2f} s\")\n\nsanoq = 0\nqulf = threading.Lock()\ndef oshir():\n    global sanoq\n    for _ in range(100000):\n        with qulf:\n            sanoq += 1\n\noqimlar = [threading.Thread(target=oshir) for _ in range(4)]\n[o.start() for o in oqimlar]; [o.join() for o in oqimlar]\nprint(\"Hisoblagich (kutilgan 400000):\", sanoq)\nPYEOF2\npython3 oqimlar.py", "parallel ishlash va Lock bilan xavfsiz hisoblash"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","Ko'p oqimli CLI port skaner (argparse + as_completed)","as_completed natijalarni tayyor bo'lgan zahoti beradi. Skaner sukut bo'yicha faqat loopback (127.0.0.1) manzilda ishlaydi; boshqa host uchun yozma ruxsat bo'lsa --ruxsat bayrog'i beriladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > tez_skaner.py\nimport argparse, ipaddress, socket, sys, time\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor, as_completed\n\ndef ochiqmi(ip, port, timeout):\n    with socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM) as s:\n        s.settimeout(timeout)\n        return port, s.connect_ex((ip, port)) == 0\n\np = argparse.ArgumentParser()\np.add_argument(\"--ip\", default=\"127.0.0.1\")\np.add_argument(\"--port-dan\", type=int, default=1)\np.add_argument(\"--port-gacha\", type=int, default=1024)\np.add_argument(\"--oqim\", type=int, default=100)\np.add_argument(\"--ruxsat\", action=\"store_true\")\na = p.parse_args()\n\nif not ipaddress.ip_address(a.ip).is_loopback and not a.ruxsat:\n    sys.exit(\"Faqat o'z kompyuteringiz yoki --ruxsat bilan\")\n\nochiq = []\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=a.oqim) as hovuz:\n    ishlar = [hovuz.submit(ochiqmi, a.ip, port, 0.3) for port in range(a.port_dan, a.port_gacha+1)]\n    for ish in as_completed(ishlar):\n        port, holat = ish.result()\n        if holat: ochiq.append(port)\nprint(\"Ochiq portlar:\", sorted(ochiq) or \"yo'q\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 tez_skaner.py --port-dan 1 --port-gacha 9000", "to'liq ishlaydigan ko'p oqimli CLI skaner"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","asyncio bilan asinxron skanerlash","Bitta oqimda minglab ulanishni boshqaradi: await kutish paytida boshqa vazifalarga o'tadi. asyncio.open_connection ulanadi, wait_for vaqtni cheklaydi, Semaphore bir vaqtdagi ulanishlar sonini cheklaydi (tizimni bo'g'ib qo'ymaslik uchun).",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > async_skaner.py\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def tekshir(ip, port, semafor, timeout=0.5):\n    async with semafor:\n        try:\n            _, w = await asyncio.wait_for(asyncio.open_connection(ip, port), timeout)\n            w.close(); await w.wait_closed()\n            return port, True\n        except (OSError, asyncio.TimeoutError):\n            return port, False\n\nasync def asosiy():\n    semafor = asyncio.Semaphore(200)\n    portlar = [22, 80, 443, 3306, 8080]\n    natija = await asyncio.gather(*(tekshir(\"127.0.0.1\", p, semafor) for p in portlar))\n    print(\"Ochiq:\", sorted(p for p, ok in natija if ok))\n\nasyncio.run(asosiy())\nPYEOF2\npython3 async_skaner.py", "Semaphore bilan cheklangan asinxron skan"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","re moduli bilan chuqur log tahlili","Regex — matndan namuna bo'yicha qism ajratish. (?P<nom>...) nomli guruh beradi, finditer barcha moslikni topadi. Diqqat: regex IP ning to'g'riligini tekshirmaydi (999.1.1.1 ham mos keladi), shuning uchun natijani ipaddress bilan tasdiqlang.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > regex_log.py\nimport ipaddress, re\nfrom collections import Counter\n\nLOG = \"\"\"Oct 18 10:01:02 srv sshd[811]: Failed password for root from 203.0.113.9 port 51022 ssh2\nOct 18 10:02:10 srv sshd[820]: Accepted publickey for ali from 10.0.0.5 port 40100 ssh2\nOct 18 10:03:44 srv sshd[833]: Failed password for root from 999.999.1.1 port 60012 ssh2\"\"\"\n\nNAMUNA = re.compile(r\"Failed password for (?:invalid user )?(?P<user>\\S+) from (?P<ip>\\d{1,3}(?:\\.\\d{1,3}){3})\")\n\nsanoq = Counter()\nfor m in NAMUNA.finditer(LOG):\n    try:\n        ipaddress.ip_address(m[\"ip\"])\n    except ValueError:\n        print(\"Noto'g'ri IP o'tkazib yuborildi:\", m[\"ip\"]); continue\n    sanoq[m[\"ip\"]] += 1\nprint(\"IP bo'yicha:\", dict(sanoq))\nPYEOF2\npython3 regex_log.py", "nomli guruh va IP tasdiqlash"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","subprocess: xavfsiz tashqi dastur chaqirish","Argumentlarni ro'yxat qilib bering va shell=True ishlatmang: foydalanuvchi kiritgan matn shell ga tushsa, buyruq in'ektsiyasi bo'ladi. shlex.quote() matnni argument sifatida xavfsiz qiladi, timeout osilib qolishdan saqlaydi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > subprocess_xavfsiz.py\nimport shlex, subprocess\n\ndef bajar(buyruq, vaqt=10):\n    try:\n        r = subprocess.run(buyruq, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=vaqt, check=True)\n        return r.stdout\n    except FileNotFoundError:\n        return f\"Topilmadi: {buyruq[0]}\"\n    except subprocess.CalledProcessError as xato:\n        return f\"Xato: {xato.stderr.strip()}\"\n\nprint(bajar([\"uname\", \"-s\"]).strip())\n\nnomalum = \"127.0.0.1; echo HUJUM\"\nprint(\"Xavfli bo'lardi:\", f\"ping -c1 {nomalum}\")\nprint(\"Xavfsiz argument:\", shlex.quote(nomalum))\nprint(bajar([\"echo\", nomalum]).strip())\nPYEOF2\npython3 subprocess_xavfsiz.py", "shell=True xavfi va shlex.quote"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","venv, pip va requirements.txt","Har loyiha uchun alohida muhit — kutubxona versiyalari to'qnashmaydi va tizim Python'i buzilmaydi. requirements.txt loyiha kutubxonalarini saqlaydi, pip install -r bilan boshqa kompyuterda aynan shu holat tiklanadi.",[["echo 'python3 -m venv .venv  &&  source .venv/bin/activate  &&  pip install requests pandas  &&  pip freeze > requirements.txt'", "venv yaratish va kutubxonalarni saqlash ketma-ketligi"], ["echo 'pip install -r requirements.txt   # boshqa kompyuterda aynan shu muhitni tiklash'", "requirements.txt'dan tiklash"]]);
A("Python: Tezlik va integratsiya","csv, pandas va matplotlib bilan natija tahlili","csv — standart kutubxona, DictReader/DictWriter bilan jadval yozish-o'qish. pandas — mingdan ortiq qatorli loglarni guruhlash va saralashda for sikliga qaraganda ancha qulay. matplotlib esa natijani grafikka aylantiradi; matplotlib.use(\"Agg\") ekransiz serverda ham PNG fayl yaratadi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > pandas_log.py\nimport pandas as pd\n\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"ip\": [\"203.0.113.9\", \"203.0.113.9\", \"198.51.100.77\", \"10.0.0.5\"],\n    \"holat\": [\"Failed\", \"Failed\", \"Failed\", \"Accepted\"],\n})\nxato = df[df[\"holat\"] == \"Failed\"]\nprint(xato.groupby(\"ip\").size().sort_values(ascending=False))\nPYEOF2\npython3 pandas_log.py", "pandas bilan guruhlash va saralash"], ["cat <<'PYEOF2' > grafik_chiqar.py\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use(\"Agg\")\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\nip_lar = [\"203.0.113.9\", \"198.51.100.77\", \"192.0.2.14\"]\nurinish = [17, 8, 5]\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 3.5))\nax.bar(ip_lar, urinish, color=\"#0f8f7e\")\nax.axhline(5, color=\"#b91c1c\", linestyle=\"--\", label=\"Chegara\")\nax.legend()\nfig.savefig(\"urinishlar.png\", dpi=120)\nprint(\"Saqlandi: urinishlar.png\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 grafik_chiqar.py", "natijani PNG grafikka aylantirish"]]);
A("Python: Professional yakuniy loyiha","Professional CLI port skaner","Oldingi bo'limlarning barchasi bitta vositada: argparse (CLI), dataclass (natija), sqlite3 (baza), pathlib (hisobot) va xavfsizlik tekshiruvi (faqat loopback yoki --ruxsat bilan). Bunday kod oddiy skript emas, balki GitHub portfoliosiga qo'yish mumkin bo'lgan haqiqiy vositadir.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > professional_skaner.py\nimport argparse, ipaddress, logging, socket, sqlite3, sys\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nlog = logging.getLogger(\"skaner\")\n\n@dataclass\nclass SkanNatijasi:\n    ip: str\n    ochiq: list = field(default_factory=list)\n    yopiq: list = field(default_factory=list)\n    vaqt: str = field(default_factory=lambda: datetime.now().isoformat(timespec=\"seconds\"))\n\nclass RuxsatYoq(Exception):\n    pass\n\ndef ruxsat_tekshir(ip, ruxsat):\n    manzil = ipaddress.ip_address(ip)\n    if not manzil.is_loopback and not ruxsat:\n        raise RuxsatYoq(f\"{ip} — faqat o'zingizniki yoki --ruxsat\")\n\ndef port_ochiqmi(ip, port, timeout):\n    with socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM) as s:\n        s.settimeout(timeout)\n        return s.connect_ex((ip, port)) == 0\n\ndef skanla(ip, portlar, timeout):\n    n = SkanNatijasi(ip)\n    for p in portlar:\n        (n.ochiq if port_ochiqmi(ip, p, timeout) else n.yopiq).append(p)\n    return n\n\ndef bazaga_yoz(yol, n):\n    with sqlite3.connect(yol) as baza:\n        baza.execute(\"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS skan (vaqt TEXT, ip TEXT, port INTEGER, ochiq INTEGER)\")\n        qatorlar = [(n.vaqt, n.ip, p, 1) for p in n.ochiq] + [(n.vaqt, n.ip, p, 0) for p in n.yopiq]\n        baza.executemany(\"INSERT INTO skan VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)\", qatorlar)\n\ndef main():\n    p = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"Professional port skaner\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--ip\", default=\"127.0.0.1\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--port\", \"-p\", type=int, nargs=\"+\", default=[22, 80, 443])\n    p.add_argument(\"--db\", type=Path, default=Path(\"skan.db\"))\n    p.add_argument(\"--ruxsat\", action=\"store_true\")\n    a = p.parse_args()\n    logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO, format=\"%(asctime)s | %(message)s\")\n    try:\n        ruxsat_tekshir(a.ip, a.ruxsat)\n    except (RuxsatYoq, ValueError) as x:\n        log.error(\"%s\", x); return 2\n    n = skanla(a.ip, a.port, 0.5)\n    bazaga_yoz(a.db, n)\n    log.info(\"Ochiq: %s | Yopiq: %s | Baza: %s\", n.ochiq, n.yopiq, a.db)\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\nPYEOF2\npython3 professional_skaner.py --port 22 80 443 --db skan.db", "argparse + dataclass + sqlite3 birlashgan vosita"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","PyAutoGUI nima va Kali'da o'rnatish","PyAutoGUI — Python kutubxonasi: dastur sichqoncha va klaviaturani inson kabi boshqaradi va ekranni \"ko'ra\" oladi. Linux'da u X11 (Xlib) orqali ishlaydi — Kali'ning standart Xfce sessiyasi X11, muammo yo'q, lekin Wayland sessiyasida ishlamasligi mumkin. O'rnatish: apt orqali (eng sodda) yoki venv ichida pip orqali (tizim Python'iga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri pip install PEP 668 sababli taqiqlangan).",[["echo \"$XDG_SESSION_TYPE\"    # x11 bo'lishi kerak, wayland bo'lsa kirishda X11 sessiyani tanlang", "sessiya turini tekshirish"], ["sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y python3-pyautogui python3-tk python3-xlib scrot xclip", "Kali'da apt orqali o'rnatish (python3-tk majburiy)"], ["cat <<'PYEOF2' > versiya_tekshir.py\nimport pyautogui\nprint(pyautogui.__version__, pyautogui.size())\nPYEOF2\npython3 versiya_tekshir.py", "o'rnatishni tekshirish"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","Ekran va kursor ma'lumotlari","Ekran o'lchamini size() beradi, kursor o'rnini position(), nuqta ekran ichida ekanini onScreen(x, y). Koordinata tizimida (0,0) yuqori chap burchakda, x o'ngga, y pastga o'sadi. Tugma qayerda ekanini bilish uchun kursor koordinatasini jonli kuzatish foydali.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > ekran_tekshiruv.py\nimport os, sys\nif not os.environ.get(\"DISPLAY\"):\n    sys.exit(\"DISPLAY yo'q: grafik sessiyadan ishga tushiring\")\nimport pyautogui\nkenglik, balandlik = pyautogui.size()\nprint(f\"Monitor: {kenglik} x {balandlik}\")\nx, y = pyautogui.position()\nprint(f\"Kursor: ({x}, {y})\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 ekran_tekshiruv.py", "ekran o'lchami va kursor holati"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","Sichqoncha: harakat, bosish, sudrash, aylantirish","moveTo(x,y,duration) mutlaq, moveRel(dx,dy) nisbiy siljiydi. click(), doubleClick(), rightClick() — bosish turlari; mouseDown()/mouseUp() tugmani bosib turish. dragTo()/dragRel() sudraydi, scroll() aylantiradi. Diqqat: noma'lum koordinatada bosish tasodifan boshqa dasturni ishga tushirishi mumkin — sinovni bo'sh joyda bajaring.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > sichqoncha_harakat.py\nimport time\nimport pyautogui\n\npyautogui.FAILSAFE = True\npyautogui.PAUSE = 0.3\nprint(\"3 soniyadan keyin boshlanadi.\")\ntime.sleep(3)\npyautogui.moveTo(500, 500, duration=1)\npyautogui.click()\npyautogui.dragRel(100, 0, duration=0.5, button=\"left\")\npyautogui.scroll(-300)\nPYEOF2\npython3 sichqoncha_harakat.py", "sichqonchani siljitish, bosish, sudrash, aylantirish"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","Klaviatura: write, press, hotkey","write(\"matn\") belgilarni ketma-ket yozadi (faqat ASCII ishonchli). press(\"enter\") bitta tugma, press(\"left\", presses=3) bir necha marta. hotkey(\"ctrl\",\"c\") tugmalar birikmasi. Emoji va o'zbekcha tutuq (ʻ) kabi Unicode belgilar write() bilan tushib qoladi — buferga nusxalab Ctrl+V bilan qo'yish yoki xdotool type ishlatish kerak.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > klaviatura_asoslar.py\nimport time\nimport pyautogui\n\npyautogui.FAILSAFE = True\nprint(\"5 soniya ichida matn muharririni oching.\")\ntime.sleep(5)\npyautogui.write(\"Salom Dunyo!\", interval=0.1)\npyautogui.press(\"enter\")\npyautogui.hotkey(\"ctrl\", \"a\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 klaviatura_asoslar.py", "yozish va tugma birikmalari"], ["sudo apt install -y python3-pyperclip xclip xdotool", "Unicode/emoji uchun bufer va xdotool vositalari"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","Ekran tahlili (Vision): rasm bo'yicha qidirish","locateOnScreen(\"rasm.png\") rasmni ekrandan topib joylashuvini qaytaradi, center() markazini beradi; topilmasa ImageNotFoundException chiqadi, shuning uchun try/except kerak. confidence=0.8 noaniq moslik beradi (opencv kerak), region bilan qidiruvni cheklash tezlashtiradi. pixel(x,y) nuqta rangini, screenshot() ekran suratini oladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > ekran_tahlil.py\nimport pyautogui\n\npyautogui.screenshot(\"ekran.png\")\ntry:\n    joy = pyautogui.locateOnScreen(\"parcha.png\", confidence=0.8)\nexcept pyautogui.ImageNotFoundException:\n    joy = None\nprint(\"Rasm topildi:\", joy) if joy else print(\"Rasm topilmadi\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 ekran_tahlil.py", "ekrandan rasm qidirish"], ["cat <<'PYEOF2' > kutish_va_bosish.py\nimport time\nimport pyautogui\n\ndef kut_va_bos(rasm, timeout=15, confidence=0.9):\n    oxiri = time.time() + timeout\n    while time.time() < oxiri:\n        try:\n            joy = pyautogui.locateCenterOnScreen(rasm, confidence=confidence)\n        except pyautogui.ImageNotFoundException:\n            joy = None\n        if joy:\n            pyautogui.click(joy); return True\n        time.sleep(0.5)\n    return False\n\nprint(\"Bosildi.\" if kut_va_bos(\"parcha.png\", timeout=5) else \"Vaqt tugadi.\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 kutish_va_bosish.py", "rasm paydo bo'lishini kutib bosish"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","Xavfsizlik qoidalari (Fail-Safe, PAUSE, axloq)","pyautogui.FAILSAFE=True (sukut bo'yicha yoqilgan) — kursorni ekran burchagiga olib borsangiz dastur FailSafeException bilan to'xtaydi, boshqaruvni qaytarishning eng tez yo'li. PAUSE har buyruqdan keyin kichik kutish qo'shadi. Kali'da favqulodda to'xtatish: terminalda Ctrl+C, u ham ishlamasa Ctrl+Alt+F3 bilan matnli konsolga o'tib pkill -f skript.py. Avtomatlashtirish faqat o'z kompyuteringiz uchun — boshqa odam akkaunti, o'yin yoki platforma qoidalarini aldash uchun ishlatish akkauntni yopilishiga yoki javobgarlikka olib keladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > xavfsiz_sikl.py\nimport time\nimport pyautogui\n\npyautogui.FAILSAFE = True\npyautogui.PAUSE = 0.5\ntry:\n    for i in range(10):\n        pyautogui.moveTo(100 + i*50, 100, duration=0.3)\n        time.sleep(1)\nexcept pyautogui.FailSafeException:\n    print(\"Fail-Safe ishga tushdi\")\nexcept KeyboardInterrupt:\n    print(\"Foydalanuvchi to'xtatdi (Ctrl+C)\")\nfinally:\n    print(\"Tozalash tugadi.\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 xavfsiz_sikl.py", "FailSafe va KeyboardInterrupt'ni toza ushlash"]]);
A("Python: GUI avtomatlashtirish","Yakuniy loyiha: avtomatik Mousepad yozuvchi","Mousepad'ni subprocess bilan ochish → oyna chiqishini kutish → matn yozish → Ctrl+S → fayl nomini kiritish → fayl paydo bo'lganini tekshirish. Fayl nomiga vaqt qo'shilgani uchun \"almashtirasizmi?\" oynasi chiqmaydi. Ishga tushirishdan oldin boshqa muhim dasturlarni yoping va loyiha ishlayotganda sichqoncha/klaviaturaga tegmang.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > avto_mousepad.py\nimport os, shutil, subprocess, sys, time\nimport pyautogui\n\npyautogui.FAILSAFE = True\npyautogui.PAUSE = 0.5\nFAYL = os.path.expanduser(f\"~/avtomatik_matn_{time.strftime('%H%M%S')}.txt\")\nMATN = \"Ushbu xabar robot tomonidan yozildi!\\nAvtomatlashtirish - bu kelajak.\"\n\nif not shutil.which(\"mousepad\"):\n    sys.exit(\"mousepad topilmadi: sudo apt install mousepad\")\n\nprint(\"3 soniyadan keyin boshlanadi.\")\ntime.sleep(3)\nsubprocess.Popen([\"mousepad\"])\ntime.sleep(2.5)\npyautogui.write(MATN, interval=0.03)\npyautogui.hotkey(\"ctrl\", \"s\")\ntime.sleep(1)\npyautogui.write(FAYL)\npyautogui.press(\"enter\")\ntime.sleep(1)\nprint(\"Bajarildi:\", FAYL) if os.path.exists(FAYL) else print(\"Fayl topilmadi\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 avto_mousepad.py", "to'liq avtomatik Mousepad yozuvchi loyihasi"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","Oyna tushunchalari va X11/Wayland","Ekrandagi har bir oyna X11'da noyob ID'ga ega. Oynaning asosiy xususiyatlari: ID, sarlavha (title, tez o'zgaradi), WM_CLASS (dastur turi, qidirishda ishonchliroq, o'zgarmaydi), joylashuv, o'lcham. wmctrl va xdotool faqat X11/XWayland oynalarini ko'radi; sof Wayland ilovalari ularga ko'rinmaydi (xavfsizlik uchun ataylab). Kali Xfce sukut bo'yicha X11.",[["echo $XDG_SESSION_TYPE && sudo apt install -y wmctrl xdotool x11-utils", "sessiya turi va kerakli vositalarni o'rnatish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","Oynalar haqida ma'lumot olish","wmctrl -l — barcha oynalar ro'yxati; -lGx joylashuv, o'lcham va WM_CLASS bilan to'liq ro'yxat beradi. xdotool getactivewindow — faol oyna ID'si, getwindowname — sarlavhasi. xprop WM_CLASS bosilgan oynaning sinfini ko'rsatadi. xdotool search --class/--name oynani qidiradi.",[["wmctrl -lGx", "to'liq oynalar ro'yxati: ID, joy, o'lcham, sinf, sarlavha"], ["xdotool getactivewindow getwindowname", "faol oyna sarlavhasi"], ["xdotool search --onlyvisible --class mousepad", "sinf bo'yicha oyna qidirish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","wmctrl bilan oynani boshqarish","wmctrl -a sarlavha — oynani faollashtiradi. -b add|remove|toggle,xossa bilan maximized_vert/horz, fullscreen, above kabi holatlarni o'zgartiradi. -e gravity,x,y,w,h bilan siljitadi va o'lchamini o'zgartiradi (avval kattalashtirishni olib tashlash kerak). -c oynani muloyim yopadi.",[["wmctrl -a \"Mousepad\"", "oynani oldinga chiqarish"], ["wmctrl -r :ACTIVE: -b remove,maximized_vert,maximized_horz && wmctrl -r :ACTIVE: -e 0,100,100,800,600", "faol oynani joylash va o'lchamini o'zgartirish"], ["wmctrl -c \"Mousepad\"", "oynani yopish so'rovi"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","xdotool bilan oynani boshqarish","windowactivate oynani to'liq faollashtiradi (ish stoli ham almashishi mumkin). windowmove/windowsize siljitadi va o'lchamini o'zgartiradi (foiz ham mumkin: 50% 100%). windowminimize yig'adi, windowclose yopadi, windowkill majburan uzadi (saqlanmagan ma'lumot yo'qoladi — faqat qotib qolgan o'z dasturingizga ishlating).",[["xdotool search --onlyvisible --class mousepad windowactivate", "Mousepad oynasini faollashtirish"], ["xdotool getactivewindow windowmove 100 100 windowsize 800 600", "faol oynani joylash"], ["xdotool key --window $(xdotool getactivewindow) ctrl+s", "faol oynaga tugma kombinatsiyasi yuborish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","Oynani kutish va fokus muammosi","Dastur oynasi sekin yoki tez chiqishi mumkin; sleep(2.5) bir kompyuterda ishlab, boshqasida buziladi. xdotool search --sync oyna paydo bo'lguncha kutadi va uni qaytaradi — bu ancha ishonchli, timeout bilan o'rab qo'yish kerak. Yangi oyna ba'zan fokusni o'zi olmaydi, shuning uchun skript windowactivate qilib, faol oyna kerakli ekanini tekshirishi kerak — aks holda tugmalar noto'g'ri dasturga yuboriladi.",[["timeout 10 xdotool search --sync --onlyvisible --class mousepad", "oyna paydo bo'lguncha ishonchli kutish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","Ish stollari (workspace) boshqaruvi","wmctrl -d ish stollari ro'yxatini, wmctrl -s N N-ish stoliga o'tishni, wmctrl -r :ACTIVE: -t N faol oynani N-ish stoliga ko'chirishni bajaradi. Xfce'da Alt+Tab, Alt+F4, Ctrl+Alt+Chap/O'ng kabi qulay klaviatura yo'llari ham bor.",[["wmctrl -d", "ish stollari ro'yxati"], ["wmctrl -s 1 && wmctrl -r :ACTIVE: -t 0", "ish stoliga o'tish va oynani ko'chirish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","Python bilan oynalar ro'yxati va yonma-yon joylash","Windows'dagi pygetwindow Linux'da deyarli ishlamaydi; Kali'da standart yo'l — subprocess orqali wmctrl va xdotool'ni chaqirish. wmctrl -lGx chiqishini satr bo'yicha ajratib, Python lug'atlariga aylantirish mumkin, so'ng ularni ekran chap/o'ng yarmiga avtomatik joylash uchun ishlatish mumkin.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > oynalar_royxati.py\nimport shutil, subprocess\n\ndef oynalar():\n    if not shutil.which(\"wmctrl\"):\n        raise SystemExit(\"wmctrl yo'q: sudo apt install wmctrl\")\n    chiqish = subprocess.run([\"wmctrl\", \"-lGx\"], capture_output=True, text=True, check=True).stdout\n    natija = []\n    for qator in chiqish.splitlines():\n        qismlar = qator.split(None, 8)\n        if len(qismlar) < 9: continue\n        oyna_id, stol, x, y, eni, boyi, sinf, _host, sarlavha = qismlar\n        natija.append({\"id\": oyna_id, \"sinf\": sinf, \"sarlavha\": sarlavha,\n                       \"eni\": int(eni), \"boyi\": int(boyi)})\n    return natija\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    for o in oynalar():\n        print(f'{o[\"id\"]}  {o[\"eni\"]}x{o[\"boyi\"]}  {o[\"sinf\"]:<20} {o[\"sarlavha\"]}')\nPYEOF2\npython3 oynalar_royxati.py", "wmctrl chiqishini Python lug'atlariga aylantirish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","PyAutoGUI bilan birga: oyna → fokus → harakat","To'g'ri tartib: 1) dasturni ishga tushirish; 2) oyna paydo bo'lishini xdotool search --sync bilan kutish; 3) windowactivate bilan faollashtirish; 4) faol oyna kerakli ekanini tekshirish; 5) tugmalarni bosish. 4-qadam xavfsizlik uchun muhim: fokus boshqa oynada bo'lsa, tugmalar noto'g'ri joyga yuboriladi.",[["cat <<'PYEOF2' > oyna_va_yozish.py\nimport shutil, subprocess, sys\nimport pyautogui\n\npyautogui.FAILSAFE = True\n\ndef ochib_kut(dastur, sinf, timeout=10):\n    subprocess.Popen([dastur])\n    natija = subprocess.run([\"xdotool\", \"search\", \"--sync\", \"--onlyvisible\", \"--class\", sinf],\n                            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=timeout)\n    ids = natija.stdout.split()\n    return ids[0] if ids else None\n\nfor vosita in (\"xdotool\", \"mousepad\"):\n    if not shutil.which(vosita):\n        sys.exit(f\"{vosita} yo'q\")\n\noyna_id = ochib_kut(\"mousepad\", \"mousepad\")\nif not oyna_id:\n    sys.exit(\"Oyna paydo bo'lmadi\")\nsubprocess.run([\"xdotool\", \"windowactivate\", \"--sync\", oyna_id])\npyautogui.write(\"Oyna faollashtirilgandan keyin yozildi.\", interval=0.03)\nprint(\"Bajarildi.\")\nPYEOF2\npython3 oyna_va_yozish.py", "oynani kutib, faollashtirib, so'ng yozish"]]);
A("Python: Oynalarni boshqarish","Xavfsizlik nuqtai nazaridan","X11'da har qanday grafik dastur boshqa oynalarni ro'yxatlay oladi, tugma hodisalarini yubora oladi va (ba'zi usullar bilan) kiritilgan tugmalarni kuzata oladi — xdotool/wmctrl kuchli, lekin zararli dastur ham xuddi shu imkoniyatdan foydalanishi mumkin (Wayland'ning asosiy maqsadi aynan shu ajratish). Himoya: ishonchsiz dasturlarni parol kiritiladigan sessiyada ishga tushirmang, noma'lum dastur xdotool/xinput ishlatayotganini ps bilan tekshiring.",[["pgrep -a xdotool; ps aux | grep -E \"xdotool|xinput|xev\" | grep -v grep", "kirishni yuborish/kuzatish vositalarini tekshirish"]]);
